# Where the five retired pages went.
#
# The nav went from eight entries that were the project's own shelves to seven
# that answer a visitor's questions (author instruction 2026-09-06). Three pages
# became one, /project/, and two became /about/. These URLs were never public,
# because the site was published with the repository still private and nothing
# links here yet, but they are in llms.txt and in the sitemap that has been
# served, so they answer rather than 404.
#
# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the build output directory, which is
# where Astro copies site/public/ (Pages documentation, read 2026-09-06). The
# syntax is `[source] [destination] [code]`, the code defaults to 302, and a
# fragment in the destination is allowed.
#
# Internal links do not rely on these: every link inside the site was repointed
# in the same commit, so a reader never pays the hop.

/selfhost/     /project/#self-hosted     301
/panel/        /project/#panel           301
/zen/          /project/#zen             301
/author/       /about/                   301
/thanks/       /about/thanks/            301

